WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.660
I'm Ava Skye, your AI assistant inside DigiMark101, helping turn marketing ideas into organized work and useful drafts.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:16.171
Work with me inside Studio, our marketing workspace, or ask about agency services for a project with an agreed scope.

00:00:16.171 --> 00:00:25.107
You bring the offer and the decisions, and I help with supported tasks without expecting you to learn every menu first.

00:00:25.107 --> 00:00:34.043
Inside the app you can talk to me by voice or you can type, using ordinary words to explain your goal.

00:00:34.043 --> 00:00:42.128
Keep contacts, sales opportunities, campaign planning, and files together in Studio, instead of switching between disconnected notes and drafts.

00:00:42.128 --> 00:00:51.064
This is practical, done-for-you assistance with supported work, not a promise that every outside service is connected or results are guaranteed.

00:00:51.064 --> 00:00:58.724
I distinguish saved records, drafts, and published results, so you can check what actually happened before moving on.

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:06.809
Ask me to add a contact, then check the saved record, knowing that adding someone does not message them.

00:01:06.809 --> 00:01:15.745
Ask me to create a sales opportunity or move a deal, then use the pipeline to see which conversation needs attention.

00:01:15.745 --> 00:01:26.383
For content, tell me your audience, offer, and tone, and ask for an email or social draft you can review and refine before using it.

00:01:26.383 --> 00:01:36.170
Six helpers support pages and offers, social posts, ad notes, search outlines, follow-up, and research, while I remain the assistant you speak with.

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:47.659
The workspace also supports calendar records, page and form drafts, and files, while the apps catalog shows connection status and the video maker prepares scripts and storyboards.

00:01:47.659 --> 00:01:58.297
For agency help, explore website design, search engine optimization, ads management, social media, content, email, and analytics, with fees and deliverables agreed in a proposal.

00:01:58.297 --> 00:02:05.957
Agency services are separate, not automatically included in a workspace account or carried out by a chat reply.

00:02:05.957 --> 00:02:15.744
Start with one offer and one audience, open Studio, then type a request such as drafting a welcome email for a new customer.

00:02:15.744 --> 00:02:26.382
For voice, allow microphone access when your browser asks, speak clearly, and check the transcript, using typing instead if your device does not support voice.

00:02:26.382 --> 00:02:37.871
You can stop the microphone or my spoken reply, inspect the result on screen, and provide missing details rather than let an ambiguous request become a guess.

00:02:37.871 --> 00:02:48.935
For your first campaign, plan one page, one form, and a short follow-up sequence, then review each piece instead of trying to launch everything at once.

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:59.573
Saving a draft does not send an email or publish a website, and sending, publishing, spending, or deleting needs the appropriate access, connections, and confirmations.

00:02:59.573 --> 00:03:10.211
Some outside delivery connections are still being built, an invoice record does not charge a card, and a queued message is not proof of delivery.

00:03:10.211 --> 00:03:21.275
We do not pay you, income is not guaranteed, and results depend on your offer, your effort, your audience, and how you carry out the work.

00:03:21.275 --> 00:03:31.062
Create your account or explore the available Studio preview, bring me one useful task, and type it or speak it inside the app.

00:03:31.062 --> 00:03:41.700
If you want agency help, use the contact path and explain what you want to build, so we can agree on the right next step.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:51.487
I am Ava Skye, and we can build your dynasty one practical step at a time, with you in control of the decisions.
